<span id="A10.T8.2.1.17.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:398.3pt;--ltx-bg-color:#E6E6E6;">
<span id="A10.T8.2.1.17.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">He’s my day one, always there since the beginning. I can trust her with anything; she’s been my day one.</span>
</span></td></tr>
