<span id="A10.T8.2.1.18.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">A term for your significant other who keeps your world running smoothly.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A10.T8.2.1.18.4" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A10.T8.2.1.18.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:398.3pt;--ltx-bg-color:#E6E6E6;">
<span id="A10.T8.2.1.18.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">Whenever things get hectic, I know my hubcap is there to keep everything together. She’s not just my partner, she’s my hubcap making the everyday run smoothly.</span>
</span></td></tr>
