<span id="A10.T8.2.1.28.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">The act of endlessly scrolling through bad news.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A10.T8.2.1.28.4" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A10.T8.2.1.28.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:398.3pt;--ltx-bg-color:#E6E6E6;">
<span id="A10.T8.2.1.28.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">I lost two hours to doomscroll on Twitter last night. To break the cycle, I’ve installed an app to curb my doomscroll habit.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A10.T8.2.1.29" class="ltx_tr" style="--ltx-bg-color:#E6E6E6;">
<td id="A10.T8.2.1.29.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
