<span id="A10.T8.2.1.29.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">The complex act of balancing multiple tasks at work.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A10.T8.2.1.29.4" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A10.T8.2.1.29.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:398.3pt;--ltx-bg-color:#E6E6E6;">
<span id="A10.T8.2.1.29.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">Working in marketing means constant jugglework, especially during campaigns. She manages her jugglework skillfully, balancing three roles seamlessly.</span>
</span></td></tr>
