<span id="A10.T11.2.4.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">The process of overcoming minor technical problems with makeshift solutions.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A10.T11.2.4.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A10.T11.2.4.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:179.3pt;--ltx-bg-color:#E6E6E6;">
<span id="A10.T11.2.4.4.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A10.T11.2.4.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">glitch</span>: a sudden, usually temporary malfunction or fault of equipment. 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A10.T11.2.4.4.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">flobber</span>: to sag and wobble.</span>
</span></td></tr>
