<span id="A10.T11.2.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A10.T11.2.5.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">gorkflump</span> (1.154)</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A10.T11.2.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A10.T11.2.5.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:105.3pt;--ltx-bg-color:#E6E6E6;">
<span id="A10.T11.2.5.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">The state of feeling confused and delighted at the same time.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A10.T11.2.5.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A10.T11.2.5.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:179.3pt;--ltx-bg-color:#E6E6E6;">
