<td id="A10.T14.2.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A10.T14.2.3.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:108.1pt;">
<span id="A10.T14.2.3.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">An emotional or social overwhelm.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A10.T14.2.3.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A10.T14.2.3.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:156.5pt;">
<span id="A10.T14.2.3.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">After the conference, my email was hit with a rockslide of follow-ups.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A10.T14.2.4" class="ltx_tr" style="--ltx-bg-color:#E6E6E6;">
<td id="A10.T14.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A10.T14.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:56.9pt;--ltx-bg-color:#E6E6E6;">
<span id="A10.T14.2.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Low</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A10.T14.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A10.T14.2.4.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:105.3pt;--ltx-bg-color:#E6E6E6;">
<span id="A10.T14.2.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A10.T14.2.4.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">lifeline</span> (6.781)</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A10.T14.2.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A10.T14.2.4.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:108.1pt;--ltx-bg-color:#E6E6E6;">
<span id="A10.T14.2.4.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">A vital support system.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A10.T14.2.4.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A10.T14.2.4.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:156.5pt;--ltx-bg-color:#E6E6E6;">
<span id="A10.T14.2.4.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">Her words were a lifeline during those stormy days.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A10.T14.2.5" class="ltx_tr" style="--ltx-bg-color:#E6E6E6;">
<td id="A10.T14.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A10.T14.2.5.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:56.9pt;--ltx-bg-color:#E6E6E6;">
<span id="A10.T14.2.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Low</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A10.T14.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A10.T14.2.5.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:105.3pt;--ltx-bg-color:#E6E6E6;">
<span id="A10.T14.2.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A10.T14.2.5.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">umbrella</span> (6.875)</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A10.T14.2.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A10.T14.2.5.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:108.1pt;--ltx-bg-color:#E6E6E6;">
<span id="A10.T14.2.5.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Protection or safeguard, shielding one from metaphorical rain.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A10.T14.2.5.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A10.T14.2.5.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:156.5pt;--ltx-bg-color:#E6E6E6;">
<span id="A10.T14.2.5.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">She was my umbrella during the stormy days of that job.</span>
</span></td></tr>
</table>
